t=1757526365"}],"short_description":"Face your greatest enemy\u2014yourself\u2014in Aether\u2019s Echo: Yazid\u2019s Paradox, a challenging 2D platformer where you control time to conquer puzzles and precise jumps. Climb a mysterious mountain filled with escalating trials, shadowy clones, and atmospheric storytelling.","steam_appid":3704160,"support_info":{"email":"quanticxerostudios@gmail.com","url":"quanticxero.com"},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}